{"seq":2,"slug":"frontend-engineering","title":"前端工程化","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":7,"docCount":22,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introMarkdown":"# 前端工程化 简介\n\n前端工程化是将软件工程的系统性方法论引入前端开发的实践体系。它不是某个具体的工具或框架，而是一套覆盖项目架构、代码质量、测试策略、组件化开发、状态管理、持续集成与微前端等多个维度的工程化思维方式。当团队规模从一两个人扩展到数十人，当代码量从几千行增长到数十万行，当产品从单一应用演变为多端多平台的复杂系统——前端工程化就成为保障开发效率、代码质量和交付稳定性的核心基础设施。\n\n本手册面向有一定前端开发经验、已经在实际项目中使用 React/Vue 等框架的工程师。如果你正在经历\"代码越来越难维护\"\"多人协作频繁冲突\"\"发布流程依赖人工操作\"\"组件难以复用\"等典型工程化痛点，这本手册将为你提供从理论到实践的系统性解答。\n\n第一章**项目架构**从工程根基出发，探讨 Monorepo 的组织方式、技术框架的选型决策，以及目录结构的最佳约定。良好的项目架构是一切工程化实践的起点——它决定了代码如何组织、团队如何协作、构建如何优化。\n\n第二章**代码质量**聚焦于代码层面的规范化治理。ESLint 与 Biome 的静态分析能力、Prettier 的格式化策略、TypeScript 的类型安全实践，以及 Code Review 的流程设计——这些手段共同构建了代码质量的防线，在 bug 进入生产环境之前将其拦截。\n\n第三章**测试策略**系统化地构建前端测试体系。从单元测试的函数级验证，到集成测试和端到端测试的全链路覆盖，再到视觉回归测试的 UI 一致性保障——测试是前端工程化中最容易被忽视却最具长期价值的投资。\n\n第四章**组件工程化**深入前端最核心的抽象单元——组件。Design System 的设计原则、组件库的开发方法论、Storybook 的文档化实践——组件工程化让 UI 从\"随写随丢\"的碎片进化为可复用、可测试、可维护的标准化资产。\n\n第五章**状态管理**厘清前端应用中最复杂的数据流问题。本地状态与全局状态的边界划分、React 生态中主流状态方案的对比，以及服务端状态与缓存策略的最佳实践——在复杂应用中，状态管理的好坏直接决定了代码的可维护性。\n\n第六章**CI/CD 与自动化**将工程化实践从开发者本地延伸到自动化流水线。Git Hooks 与 Lefthook 的本地守护、GitHub Actions 的持续集成管道、自动化发布的版本管理——自动化是工程化的终极目标：让机器做机器的事，让人专注于创造性工作。\n\n第七章**微前端**探索大型前端应用的架构拆分方案。微前端的核心概念与适用场景、Module Federation 的技术实现，以及多种集成策略的权衡——当单一前端应用膨胀到难以管理时，微前端为团队提供了独立开发、独立部署的可能性。\n\n前端工程化的核心不在于追逐最新的工具，而在于建立标准化、自动化、可度量的工程体系。本手册的目标是帮助你构建这套体系的认知框架，从而在面对任何规模的前端项目时，都能做出合理的工程化决策。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"project-architecture","title":"项目架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/project-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monorepo-structure","title":"Monorepo 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/project-architecture/monorepo-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"framework-selection","title":"框架选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/project-architecture/framework-selection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"directory-conventions","title":"目录约定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/project-architecture/directory-conventions"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-quality","title":"代码质量","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/code-quality","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eslint-and-biome","title":"ESLint 与 Biome","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/code-quality/eslint-and-biome"},{"seq":2,"slug":"prettier-and-formatting","title":"Prettier 与代码格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/code-quality/prettier-and-formatting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"type-safety-strategies","title":"类型安全策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/code-quality/type-safety-strategies"},{"seq":4,"slug":"code-review-practices","title":"Code Review 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/code-quality/code-review-practices"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-strategy","title":"测试策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/testing-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"unit-testing","title":"单元测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/testing-strategy/unit-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"integration-and-e2e-testing","title":"集成测试与端到端测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/testing-strategy/integration-and-e2e-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"visual-regression-testing","title":"视觉回归测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/testing-strategy/visual-regression-testing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"component-engineering","title":"组件工程化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/component-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-system-foundations","title":"Design System 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/component-engineering/design-system-foundations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"component-library-development","title":"组件库开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/component-engineering/component-library-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"storybook-and-documentation","title":"Storybook 与文档化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/component-engineering/storybook-and-documentation"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"state-management","title":"状态管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/state-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"local-vs-global-state","title":"本地状态与全局状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/state-management/local-vs-global-state"},{"seq":2,"slug":"react-state-solutions","title":"React 状态方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/state-management/react-state-solutions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"server-state-and-caching","title":"服务端状态与缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/state-management/server-state-and-caching"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"ci-cd-and-automation","title":"CI/CD 与自动化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/ci-cd-and-automation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"git-hooks-and-lefthook","title":"Git Hooks 与 Lefthook","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/ci-cd-and-automation/git-hooks-and-lefthook"},{"seq":2,"slug":"github-actions-pipeline","title":"GitHub Actions 流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/ci-cd-and-automation/github-actions-pipeline"},{"seq":3,"slug":"automated-releases","title":"自动化发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/ci-cd-and-automation/automated-releases"}]},{"seq":7,"slug":"micro-frontends","title":"微前端","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/micro-frontends","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"micro-frontend-concepts","title":"微前端概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/micro-frontends/micro-frontend-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"module-federation","title":"Module Federation 模块联邦","url":"/l-doc-